  "goodToKnow": "Die Belegschaft is the workforce or staff of a company: die gesamte Belegschaft. In Germany, the Belegschaft elects a Betriebsrat (works council) in companies with five or more employees, which has strong rights to be consulted on hiring, firing and working hours. In large companies, employees also sit on the supervisory board (Mitbestimmung). Plural: die Belegschaften."
